607	     * Whether the given city is approaching its owner capacity, i.e. it already contains between 40
608	     * and 49 owners (inclusive) and so is nearing the {@link #isCityAtCapacity(String) hard capacity
609	     * limit} of 50. When true, a newly created owner in that city is flagged with a
610	     * {@code capacityWarning}; the hard rejection at 50 is unchanged. Cities are compared
611	     * case-insensitively.
